; 756  : #endif // NEWASMTRI\
; 757  : 
; 758  : // AHansen 6/4/00
; 759  : // I hacked these out because they don't handle clipped tri's.  We (I) should probably add clipping 
; 760  : // to these but on the other hand, these get executed rarely; most of the time the asm code handles 
; 761  : // the tri's.  I ran the this using the d3d runtime for tnl on an Athlon 950 with and without this 
; 762  : // enabled and the differences in the scores were in the noise range so this is probably okay.
; 763  : // AHansen 6/17/00 added the strips and fans
